WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
I don’t know if I can go in before two o’clock.

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:02,800
This copy is about to be refreshed and attract people.

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:03,960
If you can't, just jump in line

4
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:05,800
We jump in line to save these people in disguise.

5
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,040
A non-player who knows nothing

6
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,480
Should we really go in?

7
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:10,840
Didn’t the vice-captain tell the captain before?

8
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:12,440
Don’t you want to refresh this copy for now?

9
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:15,120
Isn’t it that the vice-captain is afraid of forming his own team?

10
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,360
Are you being compared with the captain?

11
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:20,440
They won't let others do it after they do it. Don't listen to him. We won't come.

12
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,320
How many people have to die when entering the game for the first time?

13
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:24,600
Just do a good deed and lock him up.

14
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:26,040
You're not trying to earn points

15
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:28,120
Do you want to buy props for your son who has just become a gamer?

16
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:31,660
Just say whether you want to earn what you want or not

17
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:34,100
This mental hospital was founded 100 years ago

18
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:35,220
You are pure patients

19
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:37,140
But it was discovered that the hospital was conducting human experiments

20
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:38,340
The patient is just lucky

21
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:40,700
The antidote is in the safe in the dean's office on the fifth floor.

22
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:43,140
You have to find a way to leave the ward and avoid the attack.

23
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:45,260
Go to the fifth floor and get the medicine and door key to escape.

24
00:00:45,970 --> 00:00:48,450
The weapon in the NPC's hand has silvery red paint

25
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:51,020
Once silver light appears on the body

26
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:52,820
It means you are injured and unable to resist
